 ('71d87d83-bb3c-50f5-9315-7ebfb79b3ed0'::uuid, 'duolingo', null, 'Submit by the document deadline for your plan; no code or recipient instruction published (admission@gatech.edu for details).', '31ea6644-193b-58af-a403-41208d80fa20'::uuid),
